;:null,&quot;height&quot;:769,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:1185426,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/178992521?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8344e6b3-1dc3-446e-9904-8422a59f0246_3732x1970.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!SbDo!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8344e6b3-1dc3-446e-9904-8422a59f0246_3732x1970.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!SbDo!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8344e6b3-1dc3-446e-9904-8422a59f0246_3732x1970.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!SbDo!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8344e6b3-1dc3-446e-9904-8422a59f0246_3732x1970.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!SbDo!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8344e6b3-1dc3-446e-9904-8422a59f0246_3732x1970.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Enron and Nvidia price action, nearly identical</figcaption></figure></div><p>There are no guarantees…this is not 1999 or the year 2000. I am only sharing the similarities. <strong>I, nor anyone, has a crystal ball to tell you the exact future!</strong> What you do with that research and information, is up to you. If Nvidia continues to behave just like Enron, then it would consolidate</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WGXT!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F72c982af-676a-432f-a963-182f9f7f687e_1860x1098.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WGXT!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F72c982af-676a-432f-a963-182f9f7f687e_1860x1098.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WGXT!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F72c982af-676a-432f-a963-182f9f7f687e_1860x1098.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WGXT!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F72c982af-676a-432f-a963-182f9f7f687e_1860x1098.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WGXT!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F72c982af-676a-432f-a963-182f9f7f687e_1860x1098.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WGXT!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F72c982af-676a-432f-a963-182f9f7f687e_1860x1098.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"860\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/72c982af-676a-432f-a963-182f9f7f687e_1860x1098.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:860,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:456776,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/178992521?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F72c982af-676a-432f-a963-182f9f7f687e_1860x1098.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WGXT!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F72c982af-676a-432f-a963-182f9f7f687e_1860x1098.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WGXT!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F72c982af-676a-432f-a963-182f9f7f687e_1860x1098.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WGXT!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F72c982af-676a-432f-a963-182f9f7f687e_1860x1098.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WGXT!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F72c982af-676a-432f-a963-182f9f7f687e_1860x1098.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">The recent pullback matches Enron’s last pull back before its final leg upwards. </figcaption></figure></div><p>So what does this mean? <em><strong>Assuming</strong></em> NVDA continues to match Enron, then ROUGHLY, it would consolidate/trend down for about 2-3 more weeks, then proceed with another breakout to the upside.<strong> That means I will be closing out my Nvidia short position…to avoid the pain of a blow off top leg, then seek to re-enter at the first break downwards, when and if a euphoric leg occurs.</strong> I will keep you updated, weekly on Nvidia. The similarities too much to ignore. </p><p>If you would like to read further:</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://law2.umkc.edu/faculty/projects/ftrials/enron/enronstockchart.pdf\">Enron’s historical price action 1998-2001 source</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20040203185943/http:/www.enron.com/corp/investors/annuals/2000/ar2000.pdf\">Enron Annual Report 2000</a>, where executives were overselling the company.</p></li><li><p>People behave today, like people did with Enron. Here are the <a href=\"https://download.ssrn.com/06/07/26/ssrn_id918519_code347008.pdf?response-content-disposition=inline&amp;X-Amz-Security-Token=IQoJb3JpZ2luX2VjELr%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FwEaCXVzLWVhc3QtMSJHMEUCIQCjVoIhdxDAf6H%2FZE3QdtxPpqlNrAUeW0qZoCpOpA65CQIgXCnQRtq4EEL4Otp6ngRvOx2tMOtPsl9x5HfLk%2F4w9qYqxQUIgv%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FARAEGgwzMDg0NzUzMDEyNTciDPTlVj7veUYQkExH5CqZBe0SROt%2BV9w%2BpQ3862QMcDmELyHipfEB0l06PYywOCQy%2Bw38pS7I6qWnz1NGGNDVa9fqC4l%2BE7%2BmIsagc2bJKPDGrDdQk3HsoMQrgy8hWwT53pneCZcwzcx49R%2BVdkYt41kwYUoDXq%2Fi36tvQKRP0z4A%2F23iSB48M%2FuERL6ZNgmNA%2BmbPeFlbsbWm3EXMYcpM1nv7g%2BBUdG3txWXTd2KqSKLmYw4kk2V6KiPQpfkC1IJxGz44V1wA2CRxolaMBZFLmt7RtzAZsUyuxaioW4picqbwqb078h7Uy6807ZYnxJjg8%2Bsi9gAjHqAOLCXRnG9OfBbchkrdnZj4xoBuALggG6909hZRch11hgDD%2BRaJrh%2FQgePhv0a%2BrWqFtPWasZ0QFlWqLrA%2B6cAnCOYOGbcYiDYQqoFYe2OlptVDfj3E%2FF5e%2FVxbE9v4j9VmhcYpsdrHCCV3aT1ODn%2BxTAvIgFDpQvTugF55uRicWtjZ3KjwLjVHcRg%2BfX9rw804S8zNO1ajJhLNmvP3sklgVCS2R0zK3vQsDB4ClwTzs9T2eSTOITO7vKLAKfbXiLxd5xoapK57mfCdVZzl0pzWQNmB1V4NwuenSXOPpuMPlLLMYbATD2UYkWfAbe6UaEPzkGJfvI%2BvTS6c5gpP59t0IKPUfVr1KGFP8fDxn%2BdEJjPSYrSviMsowiIe1cUrwcvnT5q4sTZyV4E4FgsmSSKv8YuNDLuzLc6vU2Xf9rB3loDSwTh4nDZFGe1vMGinAEhH3t0i8qK4OnaqoOp9%2F%2Bq2DGE684HcNWhR0DiYEWMAHSaSU%2BI38ZeWpT3ItpqirnDEWmWTCB0HiqK0IcedYbm651ObsDV8kJb%2BJbmk%2BIWA7GSVFofy3R0MG8TI5EiN5ZUMM7n4sgGOrEBy52zyAH0dBNyip7D6HFwfts7VY45tlnvnIVADhJyvlOOo8MadK0G6pKxkvKINfYNPuf1cVb2eRB4Ooa9k4YhEZ81Ukh8r%2FFQ40jpwISCTq4Sl8%2F6zmvG23DXQM4MXMb%2F2TiGPNfBXcWpyNCjgYiU1lK%2FNmoxKHjVPpmCvH23F8rHm8BPPJuTaK5Tmu60cC%2B%2BQUEWkwFD6wBwhIZ0xIHrVdv%2FKmuYlpKmqr4YZTsihc7C&amp;X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&amp;X-Amz-Date=20251115T181319Z&amp;X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&amp;X-Amz-Expires=300&amp;X-Amz-Credential=ASIAUPUUPRWE65JZBX67%2F20251115%2Fus-east-1%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&amp;X-Amz-Signature=6f2dabec6c0e28fe23bea3038835494d08924a5cee7bc63587226fe346708749&amp;abstractId=918519\">Yahoo Message Boards</a> conversations. Many smug, “up only” people back then to, with some skeptics, like me.</p></li></ul><p>I reiterate: THERE ARE NO GUARANTEES IT DOES THE EXACT SAME THING AS ENRON. However, the similarities cannot be disregarded. Do what is best for you. <em><strong>I am available in the chat during market hours</strong></em> if you want to talk further or have questions. I don’t say this to scare you…I say this for people to avoid unnecessary, potential, portfolio pain. Thanks for stopping by! </p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok?utm_source=user-menu\">StockTok Main Page</a> |</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Positions</a> |</strong></em> <em><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a> </strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><p>Other Reserources: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a><em><strong> | </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing For Beginners Series</a> <em><strong>|</strong> </em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/90-of-traders-fail-and-100-of-them?r=4z8lgl\">Tools Tim Built for TradingView</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-frequently-asked-questions?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Screener FAQ</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/losers-dollar-cost-average-down?r=4z8lgl\">How to DCA UP!</a> </p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progre